{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "26af40bac7528292d963ede7c2676aff4e21d210d88bb64c22681b201093e468", "ja": "輝き始めたミルキーウェイ！", "zh": "『Milky Way』开始闪耀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9a970a41f73229cd752bd112a9b879c87b9d41d00c9f6100f8e6e55afa774c37", "ja": "新ユニット『ミルキーウェイ』のメンバーに\n選ばれた美希、昴、千鶴、朋花、紗代子の5\n人。気合充分なメンバー達を見て、リーダー\nの美希も楽しげにやる気を見せるのだった。", "zh": "美希、昴、千鹤、朋花、纱代子，\n以上五人被选为新团体『Milky Way』的成员。\n看到成员们充满热忱，\n队长美希也开心地展现自己的干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f2f704d4df332928941e6aa979b8552fbe1f8d8e18d6a231635707adb2fd06b0", "ja": "と、いうわけで……。", "zh": "事情就是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d7fe6e867e4c0f5db1bbdd8327ded777f860e49da5d9a3fd25625485be9ef627", "ja": "ここにいるみんなに、ユニット『ミルキーウェイ』を\n組んでもらうことになった。よろしくな！", "zh": "事务所决定要让在场的各位\n组成团体『Milky Way』。请多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "23a9c0e7890a8cc1789c629eebac9320c0bae9c7bdb16ff92f742e0580362e8b", "ja": "すっげー！\n千鶴、オレ達のユニットだって！　やったな！", "zh": "好厉害喔！\n千鹤，我们要组成团体耶！太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "46243d38304bce49af7d45f37192749c7e3d27bf735e67a21111cc95091e2768", "ja": "ええ、やりましたわね！　{$P$}、\nどうぞ存分にご期待くださいまし。", "zh": "是啊，真是太好了！\n{$P$}，请你好好期待吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "736d7e11acca25551d1addce89e8e7235ab21e04924d83b7e78da4aa839902fb", "ja": "わたくし二階堂千鶴、セレブとしてファンのみなさまに\n必ずや豪華絢爛なステージをお見せいたしますわ！", "zh": "本小姐二阶堂千鹤身为名流，\n一定会向粉丝们展现绚烂豪华的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8ff037d580faf1be93160f85aa09d31b294ff7369ad443b790a70cd16d26df54", "ja": "その意気です、千鶴さん！", "zh": "这么积极就对了，千鹤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "52bd9ec96e5a491ce94d863c4cbdce0dd7d1f14133667c88fcb757fc20b67ccd", "ja": "うふふ、聖母である私の、新しい晴れ舞台……。\n今から子豚ちゃん達の鳴き声が聞こえてきそうです～♪", "zh": "呵呵，身为圣母的我将站上崭新的大舞台……\n现在仿佛已经能听见小猪们的叫声了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "59f9868741d51b1023b7cd829c9c62206c98873e1146d0646dbc40f2a8fde5a0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、私達のために\n頑張ってくださいね～？　期待していますよ～♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n请你要为了我们好好努力喔～我期待你的表现～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "61f32d11c76ee56e4e5bda34caa25d80a93c151004affa8a1cc5eb1022c481bc", "ja": "もちろん、全力でサポートするつもりだ！", "zh": "那当然，我会尽全力协助你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "93958bbdc42036124dbbc922374b5ea609a3167a4b53a5134b43dc4e04958059", "ja": "ついに私も、アイドルユニットの一員に……！\n夢みたいです、{$P$}！", "zh": "我终于也成为偶像团体的一员了……！\n简直就像做梦一样，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "4ef868a2c6092514bf08ba399768d0a75206db9ffd23110b998de7ce57fdc347", "ja": "今から燃えてきました！　私、全力で頑張りますね！\nたとえ燃え尽きても、力の限り！", "zh": "我燃起斗志了！我也会尽全力加油！\n就算燃烧殆尽，也要全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c92e7b3d4d748f1d5c74d3f742cef24007cead2157013ca9929c52eaea2e5814", "ja": "はは、公演前に燃え尽きないでくれよ？\nとにかく、一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "哈哈，可别在公演开始前就燃烧殆尽啊。\n总之，大家一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "610269828598c38bfe3ee9051ba2201c8d1194e9907106a0f092d30f8e530446", "ja": "さて、それはいいとして……。\nリーダーの美希はまだなのか？", "zh": "好啦，精神喊话先到这边……\n怎么没看到队长美希呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "834cdd29d211fd1074a39c1cd02c165dd500844d46ee10039e534494f8514bd6", "ja": "えっ……あれ？\n私達と一緒に来たはずですけど……？", "zh": "咦……奇怪？\n她是和我们一起过来的啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "70c3201f85613d7cbd9088b2dadc1fbee62c75c4bc79bda31888d1d1f216f506", "ja": "むにゃむにゃ……。\nやん……くすぐったいの～……☆", "zh": "呼……呼……\n讨厌……好痒喔……☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "6f3c9daabd5a77aeb2c692a9f3f8aa849d54ad61a46d85b3f0ed07ffed88a0d7", "ja": "この声は……わかった、奥のソファーだ！\n美希～、起きなきゃダメだって～！", "zh": "这声音……我知道了，她在后面的沙发上！\n美希～快点起来啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "3f934f5743b77b8447b7f3fd468606135dc2cdcca2b7c5b3ca5bb6eb3ea4cb62", "ja": "あふぅ……おはようなの～。\nみんな、どーしたの？", "zh": "啊呼……早安唷～\n大家怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "296a8bfb40b7b1825dfad0ffe6dad5007d2263fcab5844eda9152113ba64d721", "ja": "あくびしてる場合じゃないぞ！\n今度の公演、オレ達でユニット組むんだって！", "zh": "都什么时候了还打哈欠！？\n下次公演，我们要组成团体耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "9ce8063943c5aaa50db319062b1b2286a600fddcfa721a154c4fbc19bb7c28ee", "ja": "それなら、ちゃんと聞いてたよ。\nミキたち、ミルキーウェイなんだよね？", "zh": "这件事的话，美希都听到啦。\n美希我们是『Milky Way』，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "416163dc7d231a22d9ef90273818ea73b8655df5146b466e80bb01bb2579dc94", "ja": "寝ながら聞いてたのか……すごいな。\nじゃあ美希、リーダーとして一言、頼めるか？", "zh": "居然边睡边听吗……真厉害。\n好吧，美希，你身为队长，可以说一句话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "2c5816c9d8c08de3c9b29e1287f695a4f9fc7ea614dfc877cb3223d312665d91", "ja": "わかったの。\nみんな、がんばろーね☆", "zh": "好唷。\n大家要加油喔～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "d0f9d2e04abe99c07f85a96bd0024e5fc23e2bc5f68d4f616fb8c5a182cd9d40", "ja": "えっ、それだけ？\nもっとさ、トクベツな感じじゃなくていいのか？", "zh": "咦？就这样？\n不用喊得更有特色点吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "13d8b63a82b15e85c31f6c8d4292b04ee20b14854efca6133d2b642386dca361", "ja": "だって、ユニットでもユニットじゃなくても、\nミキたちがすることは、いつもと同じって思うな。", "zh": "因为不管有没有组成团体，\n美希觉得要做的事情都和平时一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "d6e6d2aece68f247dc3ba2f7573df67269db0467dd111655d9720e90c78784e0", "ja": "することは同じ……。\nそっか。そうですよね！", "zh": "和平时一样……\n我懂了，你说得对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "0cb548520f254148e30b7c9ddfd69632f57ab044b01bca1705472bc38ef0940d", "ja": "私達はみんなに喜んでもらうために、レッスンもお仕事\nも頑張るだけです。ユニットでも、そうじゃなくても！", "zh": "为了让观众开心，我们只要努力练习和工作就行了。\n无论是不是团体，都是一样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "bf2addffb757f3f445297c028823c2a73c79c5e3c0652202228e170ef35e044b", "ja": "次の公演に向けては、この5人で、\nいつもと同じように頑張る。そういうことですわね！", "zh": "所以说为了下次的公演，\n我们五个要一起像平时一样努力。就是这个意思对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "e2c6ba7d8e093bfb86d78e953135205967b57c8307db728d796aceffd9c536c2", "ja": "それでは、今度の公演では5人で一緒に、\n子豚ちゃん達を喜ばせてあげましょう～♪", "zh": "那么，下次公演就让我们五个人\n一起让小猪们开心吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "4df615d214facbe9a895e683e97dffd9804097a1a34f21f3c6beb165478218cc", "ja": "5人で一緒かぁ。つまりチームになるってことだよな！\nわかった、{$P$}！", "zh": "五个人一起是吗？就像组成球队一样吧！\n我知道啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "b1bbcd8a2f1be073d3e0d98745b90bb9f24629ace96a5cae64a34e36f7411d4c", "ja": "みんなでチームになって、で、いつもと同じように。\n子豚ちゃん達を喜ばせるぜ！", "zh": "大家组成一队，然后，就像平时一样，\n让小猪们开心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "6e7bdac3b644f68349c540975902e1bf3ec220d848a014f24a9eaf29d2a33c95", "ja": "ああ、子豚ちゃん達以外のファンも頼むぞ！", "zh": "没错，小猪以外的粉丝也麻烦你们啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "a5bc2155cf56641618042edd94eb7a101765afc66f0a8094d3c61f4cc37041a1", "ja": "ね、やっぱり、みんながんばろーなの♪", "zh": "看吧，到头来还是大家一起加油唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1032_031tom", "source_sha256": "f09a729e75ab0e40b231df456c2653c4ff1d3e29016d2e57c0f59d3e40482775", "ja": "では、私達5人がひとつになるためにも、\nまずスケジュールを合わせた方がよさそうですね～。", "zh": "那么，为了让我们五人能团结一心，\n应该要先调整行程才能互相配合吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1033_038chz", "source_sha256": "927a54a25932dece9147f93def3d434dd2c66e5f090be903464cc455322f86b3", "ja": "賛成ですわ。\n{$P$}、会議室に参りましょう！", "zh": "本小姐也赞成。\n{$P$}，一起去会议室吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "abdfd2380fc8d182d14f086698e681e1895f49bf3d22e3398f8ca3d567aecbc6", "ja": "わかりました！\nちょっと準備があるんで、先に行っててください。", "zh": "知道了！\n不过我要准备一下，你们先过去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "35e1b9c8afa37fc30c2d8d683c50e288e271f15067467e6d048fd0f258c341fd", "ja": "……あれ？　どうした、美希。\n行かないのか？", "zh": "……咦？怎么了？美希。\n你不过去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1036_003mik", "source_sha256": "3f92c084c23643b77e46f59c57e5f439151cf046d9f26898f14ec52e14c26e76", "ja": "{$P$}。\nみんな、なんだか楽しそうだよね？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n大家好像都很开心耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "2b6f00c49ac800fc2be72fe8b8ac3377221228ed7e57f086116561b5bc0c73a1", "ja": "そうだな。新しいユニットだし、新しい活動だから。\n……美希はそうでもないのか？", "zh": "是啊，毕竟是新团体、新活动嘛。\n……美希，你不开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_01_1038_003mik", "source_sha256": "3f7ee1ed2ae97e1730399bcf4a305f54c3d9bee05fbe205dd6c988d5640bf3ab", "ja": "ううん、その反対！　あはっ☆", "zh": "没有喔，正好相反！啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
